<title>USA: Federated Department Stores Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Federated Department Stores Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.12     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net profit		 24,059     loss	37,946</p>
<p> Revs		    3,409,091		3,300,665</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  208,235		  206,710</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call estimate was profit $0.09.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 net includes $36.6 million pre-tax inventory adjustment and $41.1 million pre-tax cost for Broadway integration.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 oper shr excluding nonrecurring items above is profit $0.04.</p>
<p>Periods ended May 3 vs May 4.</p>
</text>
